# Files in this repo that are NOT part of the published site.
#
# The assets directory is the repo root, so without this every tracked file was
# served: CLAUDE.md, the Worker sources, and unsent newsletter drafts marked
# "DRAFT — private preview pending" were all publicly readable and crawlable.
# Nothing secret leaked — the repo is public and secrets are Worker bindings —
# but none of it belongs on the site.
#
# Do NOT add _redirects or _headers here. They are read by the asset layer as
# configuration and are never served as files; excluding them from the upload
# would silently turn the routing off.

# Worker source and its build inputs
src/
scripts/
wrangler.jsonc

# The subscribe Worker lives in the same repo but deploys separately
worker/

# Newsletter drafts, including unsent issues
newsletter/

# Project tooling and working notes
.claude/
.wrangler/
CLAUDE.md
HANDOFF.md
.gitignore
.assetsignore
